From 43e5c60e45d813d56c905f019ad0c74415b0da24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mathias Berchtold <mberchtold@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 14 May 2026 18:30:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Check if the CC environment variable is defined in perlasm
 scripts. When building on Windows, in a standard Visual Studio Developer
 Command Prompt, the CC environment variable is not set by default.

---
 crypto/aes/asm/aes-cfb-avx512.pl       | 6 +++---
